  "title": "I-CARE and CONFESS: Interference and Forget-Set Misalignment in Unlearning",
  "summary": "I-CARE introduces a methodology for analyzing interference patterns in machine unlearning, while CONFESS addresses forget-set misalignment by aligning unlearning targets with model knowledge. Both studies provide frameworks for systematically evaluating and addressing these challenges in unlearning processes.",
